      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but the dashboard is flagging it as a 'low granularity' report. it's only 5 points and our leads really want to see every tiny detail broken down so nothing gets missed in triage. \n\ncan you expand this into a much more detailed, granular report? try to break down the sequence of events and the environment specifics even further. just please don't do that thing where you just repeat the same info in different ways to pad the count—the devs will hate that. just be as thorough as possible with the actual details.",
