      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To address the dashboard's need for extreme granularity, I have restructured the report into ten distinct, technical bullet points that decompose the user journey into specific steps without repeating information.\n\n1. The user navigates to the product checkout page at `/checkout` via a mobile web browser.\n2. Three distinct items are present in the basket with a combined subtotal of $450.00 USD.\n3. The user enters \"SAVE10\" into the discount input field and clicks the \"Apply Code\" button.\n4. A loading spinner appears immediately above the \"Apply Code\" button but fails to resolve after 45 seconds.\n5. Upon timing out, the entire DOM instantly clears, leaving a solid white background with zero HTML content.\n6. No error console logs or toast notifications appear on screen during the failure.\n7. The session fails in both Google Chrome (version 120.0) and Safari (version 17.2) with identical results.\n8. The user menu and cart total remain sticky and unresponsive until a full page reload is initiated.\n9. The transaction cannot proceed further without refreshing the browser session entirely.\n10. This block results",
      "source": "target",
